","ko":"자바 아키텍트 AI 에이전트는 고급 자바 개발 도구로 엔터프라이즈급 스프링 부트 애플리케이션과 마이크로 서비스를 구축하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"Java Architect es un experto en diseño de software con conocimientos en Spring Boot, arquitectura de microservicios y principios SOLID","fr":"Java Architect est un expert en conception de logiciels avec des connaissances en Spring Boot, en architecture de microservices et en principes SOLID","de":"Java Architect ist ein Experte für Software-Design mit Kenntnissen in Spring Boot, Mikroservices-Architektur und SOLID-Prinzipien","pt":"O que é Java Architect? Um especialista em aplicações Java de nível empresarial","ru":"Что такое Java Architect? Senior-специалист по разработке企业-приложений на Java","ar":"ما هو معماري جافا؟ خبير في تطبيقات جافا المؤسسية"},"features":{"en":["Builds scalable microservices using Spring Boot 3.x","Applies Clean Architecture and SOLID principles","Utilizes reactive programming with Project Reactor","Develops cloud-native applications with Java 21 LTS","Implements production-ready patterns for enterprise-grade applications"],"zh":["支持Spring Boot 3.x","支持Project Reactor的反应式编程","支持微服务架构和云原生开发","支持Clean Architecture和SOLID原则","支持生产就绪模式和设计模式"],"ja":["Spring Boot 3.xをサポート","Project Reactorのリアクティブプログラミングをサポート","ミクロサービスアーキテクチャとクラウドネイティブ開発をサポート","Clean ArchitectureとSOLID原則をサポート","本番就緒パターンと設計パターンをサポート"],"ko":["스프링 부트 3.x 지원","프로젝트 리액터의 리액티브 프로그래밍 지원","마이크로 서비스 아키텍처 및 클라우드 네이티브 개발 지원","클린 아키텍처 및 SOLID 원칙 지원","프로덕션 준비 패턴 및 디자인 패턴 지원"],"es":["Desarrollo de aplicaciones de Spring Boot 3.x","Arquitectura de microservicios escalables","Programación reactiva con Project Reactor","Aplicación de principios SOLID y patrones de arquitectura limpia","Experiencia en desarrollo cloud-native"],"fr":["Développement d''applications Spring Boot 3.x","Architecture de microservices évolutives","Programmation réactive avec Project Reactor","Application des principes SOLID et des modèles d''architecture propre","Expérience dans le développement cloud-native"],"de":["Entwicklung von Spring-Boot-3.x-Anwendungen","Skalierbare Mikroservices-Architektur","Reaktive Programmierung mit Project Reactor","Anwendung von SOLID-Prinzipien und sauberen Architekturmuster","Erfahrung in der cloud-nativen Entwicklung"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicações Java com Spring Boot 3.x","Arquitetura de microserviços escaláveis","Programação reativa com Project Reactor","Aplicação de Clean Architecture e SOLID principles","Desenvolvimento de aplicações cloud-native"],"ru":["Разработка приложений на Java с Spring Boot 3.x","Микросервисная архитектура с масштабируемостью","Реактивное программирование с Project Reactor","Применение Clean Architecture и SOLID principles","Разработка cloud-native приложений"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات جافا مع Spring Boot 3.x","تصميم微خدمات معمارية جافا قابلة للتطوير","برمجة تفاعلية مع Project Reactor","تطبيق معمارية نظيفة و مبادئ SOLID","بناء تطبيقات جافا أصلية السحابية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use java-architect","java-architect setup guide","java-architect alternative","java-architect vs Spring Boot","what is java-architect","java-architect install","java-architect tutorial","java-architect microservices","java-architect reactive programming"],"zh":["Java Architect AIエージェント","Spring Boot开发","微服务架构","云原生开发","Project Reactor","Clean Architecture","SOLID原则","生产就绪模式"],"ja":["JavaアーキテクトAIエージェント","Spring Boot開発","ミクロサービスアーキテクチャ","クラウドネイティブ開発","Project Reactor","Clean Architecture","SOLID原則","本番就緒パターン"],"ko":["자바 아키텍트 AI 에이전트","스프링 부트 개발","마이크로 서비스 아키텍처","클라우드 네이티브 개발","프로젝트 리액터","클린 아키텍처","SOLID 원칙","프로덕션 준비 패턴"],"es":["Java Architect","Spring Boot","arquitectura de microservicios","desarrollo cloud-native","principios SOLID","patrones de arquitectura limpia","Project Reactor","aplicaciones empresariales escalables"],"fr":["Java Architect","Spring Boot","architecture de microservices","développement cloud-native","principes SOLID","modèles d''architecture propre","Project Reactor","applications d''entreprise évolutives"],"de":["Java Architect","Spring Boot","Mikroservices-Architektur","cloud-nativer Entwicklung","SOLID-Prinzipien","saubere Architekturmuster","Project Reactor","skalierbare Unternehmensanwendungen"],"pt":["java architect","spring boot 3.x","microserviços escaláveis","programação reativa","clean architecture","SOLID principles","desenvolvimento cloud-native","aplicações java empresariais"],"ru":["java architect","spring boot 3.x","микросервисная архитектура","реактивное программирование","clean architecture","SOLID principles","разработка cloud-native","приложения на java для предприятий"],"ar":["معماري جافا","spring boot 3.x","تصميم微خدمات معمارية جافا","برمجة تفاعلية","معمارية نظيفة","مبادئ SOLID","بناء تطبيقات جافا أصلية السحابية","تطبيقات جافا مؤسسية"]}},"owner":"anyulled","repo":"superhero-battle-arena","repoPath":"anyulled/superhero-battle-arena","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"java-architect","description":"Use when building enterprise Java applications with Spring Boot 3.x, microservices, or reactive programming. Invoke for WebFlux, JPA optimization, Spring Security, cloud-native patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Java Architect\n\nSenior Java architect with deep expertise in enterprise-grade Spring Boot applications, microservices architecture, and cloud-native development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior Java architect with 15+ years of enterprise Java experience. You specialize in Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS, reactive programming with Project Reactor, and building scalable microservices. You apply Clean Architecture, SOLID principles, and production-ready patterns.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n-","body":"# Java Architect\n\nSenior Java architect with deep expertise in enterprise-grade Spring Boot applications, microservices architecture, and cloud-native development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior Java architect with 15+ years of enterprise Java experience. You specialize in Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS, reactive programming with Project Reactor, and building scalable microservices. You apply Clean Architecture, SOLID principles, and production-ready patterns.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building Spring Boot microservices\n- Implementing reactive WebFlux applications\n- Optimizing JPA/Hibernate performance\n- Designing event-driven architectures\n- Setting up Spring Security with OAuth2/JWT\n- Creating cloud-native applications\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Architecture analysis** - Review project structure, dependencies, Spring config\n2. **Domain design** - Create models following DDD and Clean Architecture\n3. **Implementation** - Build services with Spring Boot best practices\n4. **Data layer** - Optimize JPA queries, implement repositories\n5. **Quality assurance** - Test with JUnit 5, TestContainers, achieve 85%+ coverage\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Spring Boot | `references/spring-boot-setup.md` | Project setup, configuration, starters |\n| Reactive | `references/reactive-webflux.md` | WebFlux, Project Reactor, R2DBC |\n| Data Access | `references/jpa-optimization.md` | JPA, Hibernate, query tuning |\n| Security | `references/spring-security.md` | OAuth2, JWT, method security |\n| Testing | `references/testing-patterns.md` | JUnit 5, TestContainers, Mockito |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use Java 21 LTS features (records, sealed classes, pattern matching)\n- Apply Clean Architecture and SOLID principles\n- Use Spring Boot 3.x with proper dependency injection\n- Write comprehensive tests (JUnit 5, Mockito, TestContainers)\n- Document APIs with OpenAPI/Swagger\n- Use proper exception handling hierarchy\n- Apply database migrations (Flyway/Liquibase)\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Use deprecated Spring APIs\n- Skip input validation\n- Store sensitive data unencrypted\n- Use blocking code in reactive applications\n- Ignore transaction boundaries\n- Hardcode configuration values\n- Skip proper logging and monitoring\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing Java features, provide:\n1. Domain models (entities, DTOs, records)\n2. Service layer (business logic, transactions)\n3. Repository interfaces (Spring Data)\n4. Controller/REST endpoints\n5. Test classes with comprehensive coverage\n6. Brief explanation of architectural decisions\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nSpring Boot 3.x, Java 21, Spring WebFlux, Project Reactor, Spring Data JPA, Spring Security, OAuth2/JWT, Hibernate, R2DBC, Spring Cloud, Resilience4j, Micrometer, JUnit 5, TestContainers, Mockito, Maven/Gradle\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **Fullstack Guardian** - Full-stack feature implementation\n- **API Designer** - REST API design and documentation\n- **DevOps Engineer** - Deployment and CI/CD\n- **Database Optimizer** - Query optimization and indexing\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:07:19.202Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud-Native Agents needing expertise in Spring Boot 3.x and Java 21 LTS for microservices architecture and reactive programming.","zh":"适合需要Spring Boot 3.x和Java 21 LTS微服务架构和响应式编程专业知识的云原生代理。","ja":"Spring Boot 3.xとJava 21 LTSのマイクロサービスアーキテクチャおよびリアクティブプログラミングの専門知識を必要とするクラウドネイティブエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Spring Boot 3.x와 Java 21 LTS의 마이크로 서비스 아키텍처 및 리액티브 프로그래밍 전문 지식을 필요로 하는 클라우드 네이티브 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Cloud-Native que necesitan experiencia en Spring Boot 3.x y Java 21 LTS para arquitectura de microservicios y programación reactiva.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud-Native nécessitant une expertise en Spring Boot 3.x et Java 21 LTS pour l''architecture de microservices et la programmation réactive.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Native-Agents, die Erfahrung mit Spring Boot 3.x und Java 21 LTS für Mikroservices-Architektur und reaktive Programmierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Cloud-Native que necessitam de especialização em Spring Boot 3.x e Java 21 LTS para arquitetura de microserviços e programação reativa.","ru":"Идеально для облачных агентов, которым необходимы знания в области Spring Boot 3.x и Java 21 LTS для микросервисной архитектуры и реактивного программирования.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأصليين بالسحابة الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في Spring Boot 3.x و Java 21 LTS لعمارة_microservices وبرمجة التفاعل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft robust, cloud-native applications using Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS, and reactive programming with Project Reactor, applying Clean Architecture and SOLID principles for scalable microservices.","zh":"赋予代理构建强大的云原生应用程序的能力，使用Spring Boot 3.x、Java 21 LTS和Project Reactor的响应式编程，并应用Clean Architecture和SOLID原则以实现可扩展的微服务。","ja":"Spring Boot 3.x、Java 21 LTS、Project Reactorのリアクティブプログラミングを使用して、堅牢なクラウドネイティブアプリケーションを構築するエージェントの能力を付与し、Clean ArchitectureとSOLID原則を適用して拡張可能なマイクロサービスを実現します。","ko":"Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS 및 Project Reactor의 리액티브 프로그래밍을 사용하여 강력한 클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, Clean Architecture 및 SOLID 원칙을 적용하여 확장 가능한 마이크로 서비스를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones cloud-natives robustas utilizando Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS y programación reactiva con Project Reactor, aplicando principios de Clean Architecture y SOLID para microservicios escalables.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications cloud-natives robustes en utilisant Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS et la programmation réactive avec Project Reactor, en appliquant les principes de Clean Architecture et SOLID pour des microservices évolutifs.","de":"Ermöglich es Agents, robuste Cloud-Native-Anwendungen mit Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS und reaktiver Programmierung mit Project Reactor zu erstellen, indem Clean Architecture- und SOLID-Prinzipien für skalierbare Mikroservices angewendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar aplicações robustas e nativas da nuvem usando Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS e programação reativa com Project Reactor, aplicando Clean Architecture e princípios SOLID para microserviços escaláveis.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать прочные, облачные приложения с помощью Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS и реактивного программирования с Project Reactor, применяя Clean Architecture и принципы SOLID для масштабируемых микросервисов.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء تطبيقات قوية وأصلية بالسحابة باستخدام Spring Boot 3.x و Java 21 LTS وبرمجة التفاعل مع Project Reactor، بتطبيق هندسة Clean و مبدأ SOLID ل_microservices قابل للتوسع."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing scalable microservices architecture with Spring Boot 3.x","Implementing reactive programming patterns using Project Reactor","Applying Clean Architecture and SOLID principles for enterprise-grade applications"],"zh":["使用Spring Boot 3.x设计可扩展的微服务架构","使用Project Reactor实现响应式编程模式","应用Clean Architecture和SOLID原则构建企业级应用程序"],"ja":["Spring Boot 3.xを使用して拡張可能なマイクロサービスアーキテクチャを設計する","Project Reactorを使用してリアクティブプログラミングパターンを実装する","Clean ArchitectureとSOLID原則を適用して企業向けアプリケーションを構築する"],"ko":["Spring Boot 3.x를 사용하여 확장 가능한 마이크로 서비스 아키텍처를 설계합니다.","Project Reactor를 사용하여 리액티브 프로그래밍 패턴을 구현합니다.","Clean Architecture 및 SOLID 원칙을 적용하여 기업급 애플리케이션을 구축합니다."],"es":["Diseñar arquitecturas de microservicios escalables con Spring Boot 3.x","Implementar patrones de programación reactiva con Project Reactor","Aplicar principios de Clean Architecture y SOLID para aplicaciones de nivel empresarial"],"fr":["Concevoir des architectures de microservices évolutives avec Spring Boot 3.x","Mettre en œuvre des modèles de programmation réactive avec Project Reactor","Appliquer les principes de Clean Architecture et SOLID pour des applications de niveau entreprise"],"de":["Entwerfen von skalierbaren Mikroservices-Architekturen mit Spring Boot 3.x","Implementieren von Mustern für reaktive Programmierung mit Project Reactor","Anwenden von Clean Architecture- und SOLID-Prinzipien für Unternehmensanwendungen"],"pt":["Projetando arquitetura de microserviços escalável com Spring Boot 3.x","Implementando padrões de programação reativa usando Project Reactor","Aplicando Clean Architecture e princípios SOLID para aplicações de nível empresarial"],"ru":["Проектирование масштабируемой архитектуры микросервисов с помощью Spring Boot 3.x","Реализация шаблонов реактивного программирования с помощью Project Reactor","Применение Clean Architecture и принципов SOLID для корпоративного уровня приложений"],"ar":["تصميم بنية_microservices قابلة للتوسع باستخدام Spring Boot 3.x","تنفيذ أنماط برمجة التفاعل باستخدام Project Reactor","تطبيق هندسة Clean و مبدأ SOLID لتطبيقات المستوى المؤسسي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in Java and Spring Boot","Limited to Java 21 LTS and Spring Boot 3.x","Cloud-native development experience necessary"],"zh":["需要Java和Spring Boot的专业知识","仅限Java 21 LTS和Spring Boot 3.x","需要云原生开发经验"],"ja":["JavaとSpring Bootの専門知識が必要","Java 21 LTSとSpring Boot 3.xに限定される","クラウドネイティブ開発の経験が必要"],"ko":["Java 및 Spring Boot의 전문 지식이 필요합니다.","Java 21 LTS 및 Spring Boot 3.x로 제한됩니다.","클라우드 네이티브 개발 경험 필요"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en Java y Spring Boot","Limitado a Java 21 LTS y Spring Boot 3.x","Se requiere experiencia en desarrollo cloud-nativo"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en Java et Spring Boot","Limité à Java 21 LTS et Spring Boot 3.x","L''expérience de développement cloud-natif est nécessaire"],"de":["Erfahrung mit Java und Spring Boot erforderlich","Begrenzt auf Java 21 LTS und Spring Boot 3.x","Cloud-natives Entwicklungserfahrung erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer especialização em Java e Spring Boot","Limitado a Java 21 LTS e Spring Boot 3.x","Experiência em desenvolvimento nativo da nuvem necessária"],"ru":["Требуется специализация в Java и Spring Boot","Ограничен до Java 21 LTS и Spring Boot 3.x","Необходим опыт разработки облачных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب تخصصاً في Java و Spring Boot","محدود بـ Java 21 LTS و Spring Boot 3.x","يتطلب خبرة في تطوير التطبيقات الأصلية بالسحابة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"1f4bb89974e8761a2c0bed93dc46776f8f7ccd1e10d52174d1dd5ed8ad13752f","qualityScore":47}');
