dity مع هيكل قياسي وتوثيق NatSpec لتنمية بروتوكولات DeFi باستخدام scaffold-contract"},"definition":{"en":"scaffold-contract is a skill that generates a standard, audit-friendly Solidity module structure for DeFi protocol development with Morpho vault v2 adapters.","zh":"scaffold-contract 是一个用于创建 DeFi 协议 Solidity 模块的 AI 工具","ja":"scaffold-contract は、DeFi プロトコル用の Solidity モジュールを作成する AI ツールです","ko":"scaffold-contract는 DeFi 프로토콜을 위한 Solidity 모듈을 생성하는 AI 도구입니다","es":"scaffold-contract es una herramienta de AI que crea un esqueleto de módulo de Solidity para DeFi","fr":"scaffold-contract est un outil d''IA qui crée un squelette de module Solidity pour DeFi","de":"scaffold-contract ist ein AI-Tool, das ein Solidity-Modul-Gerüst für DeFi erstellt","pt":"O scaffold-contract é uma habilidade que cria um esqueleto de módulo Solidity para desenvolvimento de protocolos DeFi","ru":"ИИ Агент scaffold-contract - это навык, который создает скелет модуля Solidity для разработки DeFi протоколов","ar":"سcaffold-contract هو مهارة تقوم بإنشاء هيكل لمODULE Solidity لتنمية بروتوكولات DeFi"},"features":{"en":["Creates a new Solidity module skeleton with a standard, audit-friendly structure","Includes NatSpec documentation for clear and concise contract documentation","Supports Morpho vault v2 adapters for popular DeFi protocols","Helps establish a consistent layout before implementation begins","Prepares a contract surface for spec-to-implementation"],"zh":["创建标准化的 Solidity 模块","包括 NatSpec 文档","适用于 DeFi 协议开发","支持 Morpho vault v2 适配器","生成 audit-friendly 结构"],"ja":["標準的な Solidity モジュールを作成する","NatSpec ドキュメントを含む","DeFi プロトコル開発用","Morpho vault v2 アダプターをサポート","audit-friendly 構造を生成する"],"ko":["표준 Solidity 모듈 생성","NatSpec 문서 포함","DeFi 프로토콜 개발을 위한","Morpho vault v2 어댑터 지원","audit-friendly 구조 생성"],"es":["Estructura estándar para módulos de Solidity","Documentación NatSpec para DeFi","Creación de esqueleto de módulo para nuevos contratos o módulos","Compatible con DeFi protocols","Establece una estruct