ld-contract alternative","DeFi protocol development tools"],"zh":["scaffold-contract","DeFi 协议开发","Solidity 模块","NatSpec 文档","Morpho vault v2","AI 工具","AI 에ージェント","DeFi 协议","Solidity 开发"],"ja":["scaffold-contract","DeFi プロトコル開発","Solidity モジュール","NatSpec ドキュメント","Morpho vault v2","AI ツール","AI エージェント","DeFi プロトコル","Solidity 開発"],"ko":["scaffold-contract","DeFi 프로토콜 개발","Solidity 모듈","NatSpec 문서","Morpho vault v2","AI 도구","AI 에이전트","DeFi 프로토콜","Solidity 개발"],"es":["scaffold-contract","DeFi","Solidity","NatSpec","desarrollo de protocolos DeFi","herramientas de AI para DeFi","creación de módulos de Solidity","estructura estándar para DeFi","documentación para DeFi"],"fr":["scaffold-contract","DeFi","Solidity","NatSpec","développement de protocoles DeFi","outils d''IA pour DeFi","création de modules Solidity","structure standard pour DeFi","documentation pour DeFi"],"de":["scaffold-contract","DeFi","Solidity","NatSpec","Entwicklung von DeFi-Protokollen","AI-Tools für DeFi","Erstellung von Solidity-Modulen","standardmäßige Struktur für DeFi","Dokumentation für DeFi"],"pt":["scaffold-contract","desenvolvimento de protocolos DeFi","Solidity","Morpho vault v2 adapters","NatSpec","contrato","módulo","DeFi","desenvolvimento de contrato"],"ru":["ИИ Агент scaffold-contract","разработка DeFi протоколов","Solidity","Morpho vault v2 adapters","NatSpec","контракт","модуль","DeFi","разработка контракта"],"ar":["سcaffold-contract","تنمية بروتوكولات DeFi","Solidity","Morpho vault v2 adapters","NatSpec","عقد","مODULE","DeFi","تنمية عقد"]}},"owner":"mgnfy-view","repo":"morpho-vault-v2-adapters","repoPath":"mgnfy-view/morpho-vault-v2-adapters","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.432Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"scaffold-contract","description":"Scaffold new Solidity contract or module skeletons with NatSpec and audit-friendly structure without implementing behavior. Use when starting new modules, adapters, or contracts.","bodyPreview":"# Skill: scaffold-contract\n\n## Purpose\n\nCreate a new Solidity module skeleton with a standard, audit-friendly\nstructure and NatSpec documentation, suitable for DeFi protocol development.\n\nThis skill focuses only on structure and interfaces, not behavior or tests.\n\n## When to Invoke\n\n- Starting a new contract or module\n- Adding a new vault, strategy, adapter, or manager\n- Establishing a consistent layout before implementation begins\n- Preparing a contract surface before `spec-to-implementation`","body":"# Skill: scaffold-contract\n\n## Purpose\n\nCreate a new Solidity module skeleton with a standard, audit-friendly\nstructure and NatSpec documentation, suitable for DeFi protocol development.\n\nThis skill focuses only on structure and interfaces, not behavior or tests.\n\n## When to Invoke\n\n- Starting a new contract or module\n- Adding a new vault, strategy, adapter, or manager\n- Establishing a consistent layout before implementation begins\n- Preparing a contract surface before `spec-to-implementation`\n\n## Inputs Required\n\n- Contract name\n- Module type (e.g. vault, strategy, adapter, library)\n- Upgradeability model (immutable or upgradeable)\n- Solidity version (if different from repo default)\n- Required inheritance (base contracts, mixins)\n- Required interfaces to implement\n\n## Actions\n\n### 1) Generate a Solidity contract skeleton\n\nThe generated contract must include:\n\n- SPDX identifier\n- Solidity pragma\n- Imports following `.codex/constraints/solidity-style.md`\n- Contract declaration\n- Explicit sections for:\n  - constants\n  - immutables\n  - state variables\n  - errors\n  - events\n  - constructor or initializer\n  - external/public function declarations\n  - internal helper functions\n\nAll public and external functions must include NatSpec comments describing:\n- intent\n- parameters\n- return values\n- assumptions (if any)\n\nFunction bodies may be empty or revert with a `NotImplemented`-style custom error where appropriate.\n\n### 2) Define explicit placeholders (TODOs)\n\nAdd inline TODO comments indicating where future work belongs, including:\n- business logic\n- accounting paths\n- external integrations\n- access control checks\n- invariants that must later hold\n\nTODOs must include context explaining what is missing and why.\n\n## Constraints and Safety Rules\n\n- Must not implement business logic\n- Must not generate or modify any tests\n- Must not introduce external calls\n- Must not assume ERC20 compliance\n- Must comply with all rules in `.codex/constraints/solidity-style.md`\n- Storage layout for upgradeable contracts must be:\n  - explicit\n  - append-only\n  - clearly sectioned\n- Public APIs must be:\n  - fully declared\n  - documented\n  - unimplemented where appropriate\n\n## Outputs\n\n- `src/<module-path>/<Contract>.sol`\n\nNo test files, mocks, or scaffolding may be generated by this skill.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Contract compiles with `forge build`\n- Formatting passes `forge fmt`\n- No tests are created or modified\n\n## Handoff\n\nAfter successful execution, this skill should be followed by:\n- `spec-to-implementation` to implement behavior\n- `implementation-to-tests` to generate scenario-based tests\n\n## Example Prompts\n\n- “Use scaffold-contract to create an upgradeable ERC4626-style vault\n  named `MorphoVault` with documented public interfaces only.”\n- “Scaffold a non-upgradeable adapter contract implementing `IMarketAdapter`\n  without adding any logic or tests.”\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:08:51.375Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DeFi-focused AI Agents needing standardized Solidity module skeletons with NatSpec documentation","zh":"适合需要标准化Solidity模块骨架和NatSpec文档的DeFi焦点AI代理","ja":"DeFiに焦点を当てたAIエージェントが標準化されたSolidityモジュールスケルトンとNatSpecドキュメントを必要とする場合に適しています","ko":"DeFi에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트가 표준화된 Solidity 모듈 스켈레톤과 NatSpec 문서가 필요한 경우에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial enfocados en DeFi que necesitan esqueletos de módulos de Solidity estandarizados con documentación de NatSpec","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle axés sur DeFi nécessitant des squelettes de modules Solidity standardisés avec une documentation NatSpec","de":"Ideal für DeFi-fokussierte KI-Agents, die standardisierte Solidity-Modulskelette mit NatSpec-Dokumentation benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA com foco em DeFi que necessitam de esqueletos de módulos Solidity padronizados com documentação NatSpec","ru":"Идеально для AI-агентов, ориентированных на DeFi, которым требуются стандартизированные скелеты модулей Solidity с документацией NatSpec","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يركز على DeFi و الذي يحتاج إلى هياكل مODULE Solidity مع وثائق NatSpec"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create audit-friendly DeFi protocol structures with standard interfaces, leveraging Solidity and NatSpec for seamless development and auditing, facilitating efficient contract implementation and testing","zh":"赋予代理创建审计友好DeFi协议结构的能力，具有标准接口，利用Solidity和NatSpec实现无缝开发和审计，促进高效的合同实现和测试","ja":"エージェントが標準インターフェイスを備えた監査対応のDeFiプロトコル構造を作成できるようにし、SolidityとNatSpecを使用してシームレスな開発と監査を実現し、効率的なコントラクト実装とテストを促進する","ko":"에이전트가 표준 인터페이스를 갖춘 감사 친화적인 DeFi 프로토콜 구조를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, Solidity와 NatSpec를 사용하여無縫な 개발과 감사 실현 및 효율적인 계약 구현과 테스트를 촉진합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear estructuras de protocolo DeFi de prueba de auditoría con interfaces estándar, aprovechando Solidity y NatSpec para un desarrollo y auditoría sin problemas, facilitando una implementación y prueba de contrato eficientes","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des structures de protocole DeFi prêtes à l''audit avec des interfaces standard, en exploitant Solidity et NatSpec pour un développement et une audition sans heurts, facilitant une mise en œuvre et des tests de contrat efficaces","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, prüffreundliche DeFi-Protokollstrukturen mit Standard-Schnittstellen zu erstellen, indem Solidity und NatSpec für eine nahtlose Entwicklung und Prüfung genutzt werden, wodurch eine effiziente Vertragsimplementierung und -prüfung erleichtert wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar estruturas de protocolo DeFi de auditoria amigável com interfaces padrão, utilizando Solidity e NatSpec para desenvolvimento e auditoria sem interrupções, facilitando a implementação eficiente de contrato e teste","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать структуры протоколов DeFi, дружественные к аудиту, со стандартными интерфейсами, используя Solidity и NatSpec для бесперебойного развития и аудита, облегчая эффективную реализацию и тестирование контрактов","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء هياكل بروتوكول DeFi صديقة للتفتيش مع واجهات موحدة، باستخدام Solidity و NatSpec من أجل التطوير والتفتيش دون انقطاع، و تسهيل تنفيذ العقود وفحصها بفعالية"},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing new DeFi protocol contracts with standardized structures","Generating consistent layouts for vault, strategy, adapter, or manager additions","Establishing a uniform contract surface for spec-to-implementation workflows"],"zh":["使用标准化结构初始化新的DeFi协议合约","为金库、策略、适配器或管理器添加生成一致的布局","为规格到实现工作流建立统一的合约表面"],"ja":["標準化された構造で新しいDeFiプロトコルコントラクトを初期化する","金庫、戦略、Adapter、またはマネージャーの追加に一貫したレイアウトを生成する","仕様から実装へのワークフローに統一されたコントラクトサーフェイスを確立する"],"ko":["표준화된 구조를 사용하여 새로운 DeFi 프로토콜 계약을 초기화하는 것","금고, 전략, 어댑터 또는 관리자 추가에 일관된 레이아웃을 생성하는 것","규격에서 구현으로의 워크플로에 대한統一された 계약 표면을 확립하는 것"],"es":["Inicialización de nuevos contratos de protocolo DeFi con estructuras estandarizadas","Generación de diseños coherentes para adiciones de bóveda, estrategia, adaptador o administrador","Establecimiento de una superficie de contrato uniforme para flujos de trabajo de especificación a implementación"],"fr":["Initialisation de nouveaux contrats de protocole DeFi avec des structures standardisées","Génération de dispositions cohérentes pour des ajouts de vault, de stratégie, d''adaptateur ou de gestionnaire","Établissement d''une surface de contrat uniforme pour des flux de travail de spécification à mise en œuvre"],"de":["Initialisierung neuer DeFi-Protokollverträge mit standardisierten Strukturen","Erzeugung konsistenter Layouts für Hinzufügungen von Tresor, Strategie, Adapter oder Manager","Festlegung einer einheitlichen Vertragsoberfläche für Spezifikations-Implementierungs-Workflows"],"pt":["Inicializar novos contratos de protocolo DeFi com estruturas padronizadas","Gerar layouts consistentes para adições de cofre, estratégia, adaptador ou gerente","Estabelecer uma superfície de contrato uniforme para fluxos de trabalho de especificação para implementação"],"ru":["Инициализировать новые контракты протокола DeFi со стандартизированными структурами","Генерировать последовательные компоновки для добавлений хранилища, стратегии, адаптера или менеджера","Установить унифицированную поверхность контракта для рабочих процессов от спецификации до реализации"],"ar":["تشرين новых عقود بروتوكول DeFi مع هياكل موحدة","توليد تصميمات متسقة لإضافات الخزنة، الاستراتيجية، المحول أو المدير","إنشاء سطح موحد للعقد من أجل سير العمل من المواصفات إلى التنفيذ"]},"limitations":{"en":["Focuses solely on structure and interfaces, excluding behavior and tests","Specific to Solidity module development for DeFi protocols"],"zh":["仅关注结构和接口，排除行为和测试","特定于Solidity模块开发用于DeFi协议"],"ja":["構造とインターフェイスのみに焦点を当て、動作とテストを除外する","DeFiプロトコル用のSolidityモジュール開発に特化する"],"ko":["구조와 인터페이스만을 중점으로 하고, 동작 및 테스트를 제외함","DeFi 프로토콜용 Solidity 모듈 개발에 특화됨"],"es":["Se centra únicamente en la estructura y las interfaces, excluyendo el comportamiento y las pruebas","Específico para el desarrollo de módulos de Solidity para protocolos DeFi"],"fr":["Se concentre uniquement sur la structure et les interfaces, en excluant le comportement et les tests","Spécifique au développement de modules Solidity pour les protocoles DeFi"],"de":["Konzentriert sich ausschließlich auf Struktur und Schnittstellen, wobei Verhalten und Tests ausgeschlossen werden","Spezifisch für die Entwicklung von Solidity-Modulen für DeFi-Protokolle"],"pt":["Concentra-se apenas na estrutura e interfaces, excluindo comportamento e testes","Específico para o desenvolvimento de módulos Solidity para protocolos DeFi"],"ru":["Фокусируется только на структуре и интерфейсах, исключая поведение и тесты","Специфичен для разработки модулей Solidity для протоколов DeFi"],"ar":["يركز فقط على الهيكل و واجهات الاستخدام، باستثناء السلوك والاختبارات","محدد لتطوير الوحدات الصلبة لبروتوكولات DeFi"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"875a02b5e84738c28b665a16f275b6297685516dba04ae787bff908b966fb6d1","qualityScore":47}');
