INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('StefKors/Commitment-tauri/tauri-native-menus', 'tauri-native-menus', 'StefKors', 'Commitment-tauri', 'community', 'tauri-native-menus StefKors Commitment-tauri community The tauri-native-menus skill provides a guide for implementing native context menus in Tauri v2 applications, benefiting React frontend developers. It documents the correct approach and common pitfalls. Tauri 原生菜单集成指南，帮助您在 Tauri v2 应用中实现原生上下文菜单 Tauri ネイティブメニューの実装ガイド，Tauri v2 アプリケーションでネイティブコンテキストメニューを実装するために Tauri 네이티브 메뉴 설정 가이드，Tauri v2 애플리케이션에서 네이티브 컨텍스트 메뉴를 구현하는 데 도움이 됩니다 Integra menús nativos en aplicaciones Tauri v2 con React. Evita errores comunes y mejora la experiencia del usuario con esta guía. Intégrez des menus natifs dans les applications Tauri v2 avec React. Évitez les erreurs courantes et améliorez l''expérience utilisateur avec ce guide. Integrieren Sie native Menüs in Tauri v2-Anwendungen mit React. Vermeiden Sie häufige Fehler und verbessern Sie die Benutzererfahrung mit diesem Leitfaden. Este guia fornece uma abordagem correta para implementar menus nativos em aplicações Tauri v2 com React frontend Этот гид предоставляет правильный подход к реализации родных меню в приложениях Tauri v2 с frontend на React يقدم هذا الدليل نهجًا صحيحًا لتنفيذ قائمة توري الأصلية في تطبيقات Tauri v2 مع واجهة المستخدم React how to use tauri-native-menus tauri-native-menus setup guide native context menus in Tauri v2 tauri-native-menus vs web-based menus implementing popup menus in Tauri v2 debugging menu event handling issues Tauri 原生菜单 Tauri v2 React 前端 原生上下文菜单 右键菜单 弹出菜单 muda AIエージェント AI 工具 Implements native context menus in Tauri v2 applications Provides guidance on adding right-click context menus to UI elements Supports popup menus in Tauri v2 Covers migration from web-based menus to native menus Offers debugging solutions for menu event handling issues tauri-native-menus is a skill for implementing native context menus in Tauri v2 applications, covering menu event handling and migration.');
