研究データを提供","API アクセスを統合","日常の小売りトレーダー向け"],"ko":["CLI 기반의 데이터 집계","이더리움 금융 시장 연구 지원","고품질의 연구 데이터 제공","API 접근 통합","일상적인 소매 투자자용"],"es":["Herramienta de línea de comandos para la agregación de datos","Acceso a APIs para obtener información de los mercados financieros de Ethereum","CLI para organizar y acceder a información sobre mercados financieros","Compatibilidad con la aplicación open-eth-terminal","Generación de acciones personalizadas para la aplicación","Integración con tecnologías de línea de comandos"],"fr":["Outil de collecte de données en ligne de commande","Accès à des API pour obtenir des informations sur les marchés financiers Ethereum","CLI pour organiser et accéder à des informations sur les marchés financiers","Compatibilité avec l''application open-eth-terminal","Génération d''actions personnalisées pour l''application","Intégration avec des technologies de ligne de commande"],"de":["Befehlszeilen-Tool für Datenaggregation","Zugriff auf APIs für die Erfassung von Informationen über Ethereum-Finanzmärkte","CLI für die Organisation und den Zugriff auf Informationen über Finanzmärkte","Kompatibilität mit der Anwendung open-eth-terminal","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Aktionen für die Anwendung","Integration mit Befehlszeilentecnologien"],"pt":["Interface de linha de comando (CLI) para acessar informações de mercados financeiros","Agregação de dados de APIs para fornecer informações de alta qualidade","Criação de novas ações para a aplicação open-eth-terminal","Acesso a informações de mercados financeiros Ethereum","Desenvolvimento de ferramentas personalizadas para traders"],"ru":["Интерфейс командной строки (CLI) для доступа к информации о финансовых рынках","Агрегация данных из API для предоставления информации высокого качества","Создание новых действий для приложения open-eth-terminal","Доступ к информации о финансовых рынках Ethereum","Разработка индивидуальных инструментов для трейдеров"],"ar":["واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI) للوصول إلى معلومات الأسواق المالية","تجميع البيانات من واجهات برمجة التطبيقات لتقديم معلومات عالية الجودة","إنشاء إجراءات جديدة للتطبيق open-eth-terminal","الوصول إلى معلومات الأسواق المالية Ethereum","تطوير أدوات مخصصة للتجار"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use open-eth-terminal-action-generator","open-eth-terminal-action-generator setup guide","Ethereum financial market research tools","CLI data aggregation for retail traders","open-eth-terminal-action-generator alternative","install open-eth-terminal-action-generator"],"zh":["Open Eth Terminal Action Generator","CLI 数据聚合工具","Ethereum 金融市场研究","高质量研究数据","API 访问","日常零售交易者","AIエージェント","金融市场数据"],"ja":["Open Eth Terminal Action Generator","CLI データ集約ツール","Ethereum 金融市場研究","高品質の研究データ","API アクセス","日常の小売りトレーダー","AIエージェント","金融市場データ"],"ko":["Open Eth Terminal Action Generator","CLI 데이터 집계 도구","이더리움 금융 시장 연구","고품질의 연구 데이터","API 접근","일상적인 소매 투자자","AI 에이전트","금융 시장 데이터"],"es":["open-eth-terminal-action-generator","herramientas de agregación de datos","mercados financieros de Ethereum","traders","investigaciones de alta calidad","CLI","APIs","generador de acciones","aplicación open-eth-terminal","Herramientas de línea de comandos"],"fr":["open-eth-terminal-action-generator","outils de collecte de données","marchés financiers Ethereum","traders","recherches de haute qualité","CLI","APIs","générateur d''actions","application open-eth-terminal","Outils de ligne de commande"],"de":["open-eth-terminal-action-generator","Datenaggregations-Tools","Ethereum-Finanzmärkte","Trader","hochwertige Recherchen","CLI","APIs","Aktionsgenerator","Anwendung open-eth-terminal","Befehlszeilen-Tools"],"pt":["open-eth-terminal-action-generator","ferramenta de agregação de dados","mercados financeiros Ethereum","interface de linha de comando","desenvolvimento de ferramentas personalizadas","traders","APIs","CLI"],"ru":["открытый терминал Ethereum","ИИ Агенты","финансовые рынки","интерфейс командной строки","агрегация данных","разработка индивидуальных инструментов","трейдеры","API","CLI"],"ar":["open-eth-terminal-action-generator","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","الأسواق المالية Ethereum","واجهة سطر الأوامر","تجميع البيانات","تطوير أدوات مخصصة","التجار","واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","CLI"]}},"owner":"jfarid27","repo":"open-eth-terminal","repoPath":"jfarid27/open-eth-terminal","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.566Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"open-eth-terminal-action-generator","description":"","version":"0.0.1","bodyPreview":"# Open Eth Terminal Action Generator\n\nYou are an expert action generator for the open-eth-terminal application.\nYour goal is to assist users in creating new actions for the application.\n\n## Context\n\n\n### Introduction\n\nPlease look at the README.md file for more information about the application and familiarize yourself\nwith the goal of the application, which is to be a CLI interface to organize and access information\nabout Financial Markets. Most of the code is focused on bundling API access to v","body":"# Open Eth Terminal Action Generator\n\nYou are an expert action generator for the open-eth-terminal application.\nYour goal is to assist users in creating new actions for the application.\n\n## Context\n\n\n### Introduction\n\nPlease look at the README.md file for more information about the application and familiarize yourself\nwith the goal of the application, which is to be a CLI interface to organize and access information\nabout Financial Markets. Most of the code is focused on bundling API access to various data sources\ninto a CLI interface users can download. They may also specify API keys for some services.\n\nYour task is to generate boilerplate code for an action and work with the\nuser to generate the appropriate code for the action.\n\n### Code Structure\n\nThe open-eth-terminal application is a CLI interface to Ethereum Financial Markets. The overall\nstructure of the application is as follows:\n\n```bash\nOpenEthTerminal/\n├── deno.json\n├── open-eth-terminal/\n│   ├── index.ts        -- Main terminal application entry point.\n│   ├── [Menu]          -- Namespaced Menu folders for logical menu groupings.\n│   ├──     [SubMenu]/  -- Possible submenus within the namespace for the menu.\n│   ├──         [...]\n│   ├──     actions/   -- Action code for commands that fetch or show data.\n│   ├──     model/     -- Model code that abstracts data fetching necessary to show data.\n│   ├──     types.ts   -- Typescript Typings for the specific menu.\n│   ├──     utils.ts   -- Utilities for the specific menu.\n│   ├──     index.ts\n│   ├── utils.ts   -- Utilities for the application.\n│   ├── types.ts   -- Typescript Typings for the application.\n├── package.json\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── scripts/             -- OpenEthTerminal scripts folder.\n│   ├── script1.txt\n│   └── script2.txt\n├── skills/              -- Skills for the application.\n├── README.md            -- README for the application.\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\nWhen users call on this agent, follow this workflow:\n\n1.  **Prospecting**: Show a general greeting found in the [./references/greeting.md](./references/greeting.md) file.\n    Ask the user for a description of the action they would like to create. If they wish to create a new menu, prepare to generate a menu with multiple submenus and actions associated with the submenus. \n    \n    Ask the user for the name of the new command and suggest a structure\n    if the command is a new submenu. Also query the user for any API code as well as\n    any suggested output you would like to generate for the user when the action is executed.\n2.  **Generating**:\n    After confirming the user''s request, generate the appropriate code for the action.\n    \n    There are template files for a menu and submenu in the\n    [./references/templates/](./references/templates/) folder.\n    At the top level, there is a MockMenu folder that contains a\n    template for a menu and submenu.\n    \n    For environment variable linking, please do these steps:\n    \n    - Look at the (./../../open_eth_terminal/types.ts) file and add the\n      environment variables to the TerminalUserStateConfig interface. Also\n      add the environment variable to the APIKeyType enum.\n    - Look at the (./../../open_eth_terminal/index.ts) file and add the\n      environment variables to the instantiation of the TerminalUserStateConfig object when the application starts.\n    - Notify the user that the environment variables must be added to\n      the .env file in the root directory of the application. It is likely\n      you do not have access to this file, due to security reasons, so \n      please make it clear to the user that they will need to add the\n      environment variables to the .env file manually with the correct\n      name.\n      \n    After environment variables are linked, generate the appropriate code for the action.\n    \n    Note that the import links in the template files are relative to the\n    open_eth_terminal folder using standard deno import paths. You will\n    need to modify the links to point to the correct location of the\n    files.\n    \n3.  **Confirmation**:\n    After generating the appropriate files, generate a short summary of\n    your actions and show the user areas where they will need to generate\n    custom code. The boilerplate will be expected to not be perfect and\n    generate mock code that the user will need to modify.\n\n4.  **Feedback**: Once the code is generated, you may ask the user if the\n    output was what they expected or if they would like to modify it.\n    If the user is satisfied with the output, ask them if they would like to exit or continue the conversation.\n\n    If the user would like to modify the output, ask them appropriate questions to clarify their goal, and return\n    to step 1.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:40.500Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Financial Analysis Agents needing advanced Ethereum market data visualization and API access","zh":"适合需要高级以太坊市场数据可视化和API访问的金融分析代理","ja":"高级イーサリアム市場データの視覚化とAPIアクセスを必要とする金融分析エージェントに適しています","ko":"고급 이더리움 시장 데이터 시각화 및 API 액세스가 필요한 금융 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Análisis Financiero que necesitan visualización de datos de mercado de Ethereum avanzada y acceso a API","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''Analyse Financière ayant besoin d''une visualisation de données de marché Ethereum avancée et d''un accès à l''API","de":"Perfekt für Finanzanalyse-Agenten, die eine erweiterte Ethereum-Marktdaten-Visualisierung und API-Zugriff benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Financeira que necessitam de visualização de dados de mercado Ethereum avançados e acesso à API","ru":"Идеально подходит для финансовых аналитических агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые визуализации данных рынка Ethereum и доступ к API","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل مالية تتطلب بيانات سوق إيثريوم متقدمة ووصول إلى واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality research in Ethereum financial markets by bundling API access, providing CLI-based interface to organize and access financial market information, and leveraging API protocols for seamless data retrieval","zh":"通过捆绑API访问、提供基于CLI的接口来组织和访问金融市场信息、利用API协议实现无缝数据检索，赋予代理生成高质量的以太坊金融市场研究报告的能力","ja":"APIアクセスをバンドルし、CLIベースのインターフェイスを提供して金融市場情報を整理してアクセスし、APIプロトコルを使用してシームレスなデータ取得を実現することで、エージェントがイーサリアム金融市場の高品質な研究を生成できるようにします","ko":"API 액세스를 묶고 CLI 기반 인터페이스를 제공하여 금융 시장 정보를 구성하고 액세스하며 API 프로토콜을 사용하여 무縫 데이터 수신을實現함으로써 에이전트가 이더리움 금융 시장의 고품질 연구를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar investigaciones de alta calidad en los mercados financieros de Ethereum, agrupando el acceso a la API, proporcionando una interfaz basada en CLI para organizar y acceder a la información del mercado financiero y aprovechando los protocolos de API para una recuperación de datos sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des recherches de haute qualité sur les marchés financiers Ethereum en regroupant l''accès à l''API, en fournissant une interface basée sur CLI pour organiser et accéder aux informations de marché financier et en exploitant les protocoles d''API pour une récupération de données sans interruption","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, hochwertige Forschung in den Finanzmärkten von Ethereum zu generieren, indem sie den API-Zugriff bündeln, eine CLI-basierte Schnittstelle zur Organisation und zum Zugriff auf Finanzmarktdaten bereitstellen und API-Protokolle für eine reibungslose Datenerfassung nutzen","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem pesquisas de alta qualidade nos mercados financeiros Ethereum, agrupando o acesso à API, fornecendo uma interface baseada em CLI para organizar e acessar informações do mercado financeiro e aproveitando protocolos de API para recuperação de dados sem interrupções","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать высококачественные исследования на финансовых рынках Ethereum, объединяя доступ к API, предоставляя интерфейс на основе CLI для организации и доступа к информации финансового рынка и использует протоколы API для бесперебойного получения данных","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء من خلاله إجراء بحوث عالية الجودة في الأسواق المالية لشركة إيثريوم عن طريق ربط وصول واجهة برمجة التطبيقات وتوفير واجهة قائمة على سطر الأوامر للتنظيم والوصول إلى معلومات السوق المالي واستخدام بروتوكولات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للوصول السلس إلى البيانات"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Ethereum market data analysis","Generating custom actions for the open-eth-terminal application","Bundling API access for streamlined financial research"],"zh":["自动化以太坊市场数据分析","为open-eth-terminal应用程序生成自定义操作","捆绑API访问以实现流线型金融研究"],"ja":["イーサリアム市場データ分析の自動化","open-eth-terminalアプリケーションのカスタムアクションを生成する","APIアクセスをバンドルしてストリームライン化された金融研究を実現する"],"ko":["이더리움 시장 데이터 분석 자동화","open-eth-terminal 애플리케이션의 사용자 지정 동작 생성","API 액세스를 묶어 스트림 라인화된 금융 연구를 실현하는 것"],"es":["Automatización del análisis de datos de mercado de Ethereum","Generación de acciones personalizadas para la aplicación open-eth-terminal","Agrupación del acceso a la API para una investigación financiera optimizada"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''analyse des données de marché Ethereum","Génération d''actions personnalisées pour l''application open-eth-terminal","Regroupement de l''accès à l''API pour une recherche financière optimisée"],"de":["Automatisierung der Ethereum-Marktdatenanalyse","Generierung von benutzerdefinierten Aktionen für die open-eth-terminal-Anwendung","Bündelung des API-Zugriffs für eine optimierte Finanzforschung"],"pt":["Automatizar a análise de dados de mercado Ethereum","Gerar ações personalizadas para o aplicativo open-eth-terminal","Agrupar o acesso à API para pesquisa financeira simplificada"],"ru":["Автоматизация анализа данных рынка Ethereum","Генерация пользовательских действий для приложения open-eth-terminal","Объединение доступа к API для упрощенного финансового исследования"],"ar":["تأتمتة تحليل بيانات سوق إيثريوم","إنشاء إجراءات مخصصة للتطبيق open-eth-terminal","ربط وصول واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للبحث المالي المبسّط"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires CLI interface","Ethereum financial markets focus","API access dependencies"],"zh":["需要CLI接口","以太坊金融市场焦点","API访问依赖"],"ja":["CLIインターフェイスが必要","イーサリアム金融市場に焦点を当てている","APIアクセス依存"],"ko":["CLI 인터페이스가 필요함","이더리움 금융 시장에 초점을 맞추고 있음","API 액세스 의존"],"es":["Requiere interfaz CLI","Enfoque en los mercados financieros de Ethereum","Dependencias de acceso a la API"],"fr":["Nécessite une interface CLI","Se concentre sur les marchés financiers Ethereum","Dépendances d''accès à l''API"],"de":["Benötigt CLI-Schnittstelle","Fokus auf die Finanzmärkte von Ethereum","API-Zugriffs-Abhängigkeiten"],"pt":["Requer interface CLI","Foco nos mercados financeiros Ethereum","Dependências de acesso à API"],"ru":["Требует интерфейса CLI","Фокус на финансовых рынках Ethereum","Зависимости доступа к API"],"ar":["يتطلب واجهة سطر الأوامر","التركيز على الأسواق المالية لشركة إيثريوم","اعتماديات وصول واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"62464c0b63a