icación de mensajes no leídos y urgentes","Compatibilidad con Claude Code y Gemini CLI","Automatización de flujos de trabajo personalizados en macOS"],"fr":["Analyse de la boîte de réception Apple Mail","Filtrage des messages par plage de temps","Identification des messages non lus et urgents","Compatibilité avec Claude Code et Gemini CLI","Automatisation de flux de travail personnalisés sur macOS"],"de":["Analyse des Apple Mail-Postfachs","Filtern von Nachrichten nach Zeitraum","Identifizierung ungelesener und dringender Nachrichten","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code und Gemini CLI","Automatisierung benutzerdefinierter Workflows auf macOS"],"pt":["Análise da caixa de entrada do Apple Mail","Filtragem de mensagens por intervalo de tempo","Identificação de mensagens não lidas, ações e prioridades","Integração com Claude Code e Gemini CLI","Automação de tarefas de produtividade","Compatibilidade com macOS"],"ru":["Анализ входящих сообщений в Apple Mail","Фильтрация сообщений по временным интервалам","Выявление непрочитанных, действенных и приоритетных сообщений","Интеграция с Claude Code и Gemini CLI","Автоматизация задач продуктивности","Совместимость с macOS"],"ar":["تحليل صندوق الوارد في Apple Mail","تصفية الرسائل حسب الفترة الزمنية","تحديد الرسائل غير المقروءة والفعلية والأولوية","التكامل مع Claude Code وGemini CLI","تحسين الإنتاجية عن طريق التutomatização","التوافق مع macOS"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use scan-inbox","scan-inbox setup guide","Apple Mail automation","scan-inbox alternative","scan-inbox vs email clients","scan-inbox install for macOS","what is scan-inbox","scan-inbox and Claude Code","scan-inbox custom workflows"],"zh":["macOS 电子邮件自动化","Apple Mail 收件箱管理","Claude Code","Gemini CLI","生产力提高","电子邮件管理工具","AI エージェント","自动化技能"],"ja":["macOS メール自動化","Apple Mail 受信トレイ管理","Claude Code","Gemini CLI","生産性向上","メール管理ツール","AI エージェント","自動化スキル"],"ko":["macOS 이메일 자동화","Apple Mail 받은 편지함 관리","Claude Code","Gemini CLI","생산성 향상","이메일 관리 도구","AI 에이전트","자동화 기능"],"es":["agente de inteligencia artificial","automatización de productividad","Claude Code","Gemini CLI","macOS","Apple Mail","análisis de bandeja de entrada","mensajes no leídos","mensajes urgentes"],"fr":["agent d''intelligence artificielle","automatisation de la productivité","Claude Code","Gemini CLI","macOS","Apple Mail","analyse de la boîte de réception","messages non lus","messages urgents"],"de":["KI-Agent","Produktivitätsautomatisierung","Claude Code","Gemini CLI","macOS","Apple Mail","Postfachanalyse","ungelesene Nachrichten","dringende Nachrichten"],"pt":["Scan-Inbox","AI para produtividade","Automação de tarefas","Claude Code","Gemini CLI","Apple Mail","macOS","Ferramentas de AI","Produtividade"],"ru":["Scan-Inbox","ИИ для продуктивности","Автоматизация задач","Claude Code","Gemini CLI","Apple Mail","macOS","Инструменты ИИ","Продуктивность"],"ar":["Scan-Inbox","AI لتحسين الإنتاجية","تutomatização","Claude Code","Gemini CLI","Apple Mail","macOS","أدوات AI","الإنتاجية"]}},"owner":"ronnycoding","repo":"my-personal-assistant","repoPath":"ronnycoding/my-personal-assistant","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.642Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"scan-inbox","description":"Scan Apple Mail inbox for unread, actionable, and priority messages. Use this when the user asks to check their email, see unread messages, find urgent emails, or triage their inbox. Returns categorized email counts and details from the last 24-48 hours.","bodyPreview":"# Scan Inbox\n\nAnalyzes your Apple Mail inbox to identify unread, actionable, and priority messages within a specified time range.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate this skill when the user asks questions like:\n- \"Check my email\"\n- \"What unread emails do I have?\"\n- \"Any urgent emails?\"\n- \"Show me actionable items from my inbox\"\n- \"Triage my email from today\"\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. Scans all inbox accounts in Apple Mail\n2. Filters messages by time range (default: last 24 hours)\n3. Identif","body":"# Scan Inbox\n\nAnalyzes your Apple Mail inbox to identify unread, actionable, and priority messages within a specified time range.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate this skill when the user asks questions like:\n- \"Check my email\"\n- \"What unread emails do I have?\"\n- \"Any urgent emails?\"\n- \"Show me actionable items from my inbox\"\n- \"Triage my email from today\"\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. Scans all inbox accounts in Apple Mail\n2. Filters messages by time range (default: last 24 hours)\n3. Identifies unread messages\n4. Detects actionable keywords (deadline, urgent, action required, meeting, request, etc.)\n5. Identifies priority/flagged messages\n6. Returns structured data with counts and message details\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Step 1: Determine Time Range\nAsk the user if they want a specific time range, or use these defaults:\n- \"Today\" or \"recent\" → 24 hours\n- \"This week\" or \"recent days\" → 48-72 hours\n- Specific request → Honor their time range\n\n### Step 2: Execute the Scan\nRun the AppleScript skill using the Bash tool:\n\n\\`\\`\\`bash\nosascript .claude/skills/scan-inbox/scripts/scan_inbox.scpt <hours> false\n\\`\\`\\`\n\nParameters:\n- `<hours>`: Number of hours to look back (e.g., 24, 48, 72)\n- `false`: Set to `true` for priority-only mode\n\n### Step 3: Parse Results\nThe script returns:\n- `success`: boolean (true/false)\n- `unreadCount`: Total unread messages\n- `actionableCount`: Messages with actionable keywords\n- `priorityCount`: Flagged/priority messages\n- `unreadList`: Array of unread message details (sender, subject, date, flagged status)\n- `actionableList`: Array of actionable messages\n- `priorityList`: Array of priority messages\n\n### Step 4: Present Results to User\nFormat the output in a clear, actionable way:\n\n**Example Response:**\n\\`\\`\\`\n📬 Inbox Summary (Last 24 Hours)\n\n📊 Overview:\n- 38 unread messages\n- 0 actionable items\n- 0 priority/flagged\n\n📧 Recent Unread:\n1. Google - Security alert\n2. C# Digest - Newsletter\n3. BAC Credomatic - Transaction notification\n... (showing top 5-10)\n\n💡 Next Steps:\n- No urgent items requiring immediate attention\n- Review newsletters when you have time\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n### Step 5: Offer Follow-up Actions\nAsk if the user wants to:\n- See more details about specific emails\n- Flag or organize certain messages\n- Extract tasks from actionable emails\n- Check a different time range\n\n## Actionable Keywords Detected\n\nThe skill identifies these keywords in email subjects:\n- deadline\n- urgent\n- action required\n- meeting\n- request\n- please review\n- asap\n- todo\n- action item\n\n## Error Handling\n\nIf the script fails:\n1. Check Mail automation permissions: System Settings → Privacy & Security → Automation → Terminal/Claude\n2. Verify Apple Mail is running\n3. Try with a smaller time range if timeout occurs\n\n## Example Usage\n\n**User**: \"Check my email from today\"\n\n**Claude Response**:\n\\`\\`\\`bash\nosascript .claude/skills/scan-inbox/scripts/scan_inbox.scpt 24 false\n\\`\\`\\`\n\nThen format and present the results to the user.\n\n## Supporting Files\n\nFor advanced usage and detailed documentation, see [reference.md](reference.md).\n\nFor examples of common use cases, see [examples.md](examples.md).\n\n## Performance\n\n- Typical execution: ~2 seconds\n- Max timeout: 30 seconds\n- Works with multiple Mail accounts\n\n## Privacy Note\n\nThis skill only reads mail metadata (sender, subject, date, flags). It does not access email body content to protect privacy.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:42.418Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Email Management Agents needing automated Apple Mail inbox analysis.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化Apple Mail收件箱分析的电子邮件管理代理。","ja":"Apple Mailの受信トレイ分析を自動化する必要がある電子メール管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동화된 Apple Mail 받은 편지함 분석이 필요한 이메일 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Administración de Correo Electrónico que necesitan análisis de bandeja de entrada de Apple Mail automatizado.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de courriels ayant besoin d''une analyse automatique de la boîte de réception d''Apple Mail.","de":"Perfekt für E-Mail-Management-Agents, die eine automatisierte Analyse des Apple Mail-Posteingangs benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de E-mail que necessitam de análise automatizada de caixa de entrada do Apple Mail.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления электронной почтой, которым требуется автоматизированный анализ входящей почты Apple Mail.","ar":"مثالي لوجوهاء إدارة البريد الإلكتروني الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل تلقائي لصندوق الوارد في بريد Apple"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to scan Apple Mail inboxes, filtering unread and priority messages within a specified time range using macOS integration and Apple Mail APIs.","zh":"使代理能够扫描Apple Mail的收件箱，使用macOS集成和Apple Mail APIs在指定时间范围内筛选未读和优先消息。","ja":"エージェントがmacOSの統合とApple Mail APIを使用して、指定された時間範囲内でApple Mailの受信トレイをスキャンし、未読および優先メッセージをフィルタリングできます。","ko":"에이전트가 macOS 통합 및 Apple Mail API를 사용하여 지정된 시간 범위 내에서 Apple Mail 받은 편지함을 스캔하여 읽지 않은 메시지와 우선 순위 메시지를 필터링할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes escanear las bandejas de entrada de Apple Mail, filtrar mensajes no leídos y de prioridad dentro de un rango de tiempo especificado utilizando la integración de macOS y las API de Apple Mail.","fr":"Permet aux agents de scanner les boîtes de réception d''Apple Mail, de filtrer les messages non lus et de priorité dans une plage de temps spécifiée en utilisant l''intégration de macOS et les API Apple Mail.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Posteingänge von Apple Mail zu scannen, ungelesene und Prioritätsnachrichten innerhalb eines bestimmten Zeitraums mithilfe der macOS-Integration und der Apple Mail-APIs zu filtern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a digitalizar as caixas de entrada do Apple Mail, filtrando mensagens não lidas e de prioridade dentro de um intervalo de tempo especificado usando integração do macOS e APIs do Apple Mail.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью сканировать входящие почты Apple Mail, фильтруя непрочитанные и приоритетные сообщения в течение заданного диапазона времени с помощью интеграции macOS и API Apple Mail.","ar":"تمكين الوكالات من فحص صناديق البريد الوارد في Apple Mail، وتصفية الرسائل غير المقروءة ورسائل الأولوية في نطاق زمني محدد باستخدام تكامل macOS وواجهات برمجة تطبيقات Apple Mail"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating email triage","Identifying urgent unread emails","Generating inbox summaries"],"zh":["自动化电子邮件分类","识别紧急未读电子邮件","生成收件箱摘要"],"ja":["電子メールのトリアージを自動化する","緊急な未読メールを特定する","受信トレイのサマリーを生成する"],"ko":["이메일 분류 자동화","긴급한 읽지 않은 이메일 식별","받은 편지함 요약 생성"],"es":["Automatización de la clasificación de correos electrónicos","Identificación de correos electrónicos no leídos urgentes","Generación de resúmenes de bandeja de entrada"],"fr":["Automatisation du tri des courriels","Identification des courriels non lus urgents","Génération de résumés de boîte de réception"],"de":["Automatisierung der E-Mail-Triage","Identifizierung dringender ungelesener E-Mails","Erstellung von Posteingangszusammenfassungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a triagem de e-mails","Identificar e-mails não lidos urgentes","Gerar resumos de caixa de entrada"],"ru":["Автоматизация сортировки электронной почты","Определение срочных непрочитанных писем","Генерация сводок входящей почты"],"ar":["تحسين التriage للبريد الإلكتروني","تحديد الرسائل غير المقروءة العاجلة","генерация ملخصات صندوق الوارد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires macOS environment","Apple Mail account access needed","Limited to scanning inbox accounts within Apple Mail"],"zh":["需要macOS环境","需要Apple Mail账户访问","仅限于扫描Apple Mail中的收件箱账户"],"ja":["macOS環境が必要","Apple Mailアカウントへのアクセスが必要","Apple Mail内の受信トレイアカウントのスキャンに限定"],"ko":["macOS 환경 필요","Apple Mail 계정 접근 필요","Apple Mail 내 받은 편지함 계정 스캔 제한"],"es":["Requiere entorno de macOS","Se necesita acceso a la cuenta de Apple Mail","Limitado a la exploración de cuentas de bandeja de entrada dentro de Apple Mail"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement macOS","L''accès au compte Apple Mail est nécessaire","Limité à la numérisation des comptes de boîte de réception à l''intérieur d''Apple Mail"],"de":["Benötigt macOS-Umgebung","Zugriff auf Apple Mail-Konto erforderlich","Begrenzt auf die Durchsuchung von Posteingangskonten innerhalb von Apple Mail"],"pt":["Requer ambiente macOS","Acesso à conta do Apple Mail necessário","Limitado à digitalização de contas de caixa de entrada dentro do Apple Mail"],"ru":["Требуется среда macOS","Необходим доступ к учетной записи Apple Mail","Ограничен сканированием учетных записей входящей почты в Apple Mail"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة macOS","يتطلب الوصول إلى حساب Apple Mail","محدود بمسح حسابات صندوق الوارد في Apple Mail"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"8e8fd8774abcb67765faf3309c0a8839dc25867b41fe74125e816f8152729f36","qualityScore":47}');
