pos"],"pt":["monorepo","arquitetura de monorepo","sistemas de compilação","gerenciamento de dependências","desenvolvimento de projetos múltiplos","Nx","Turborepo","Bazel","Lerna"],"ru":["монорепозиторий","архитектура монорепозитория","системы сборки","управление зависимостями","разработка нескольких проектов","Nx","Turborepo","Bazel","Lerna"],"ar":["مونوريبوزيتوري","هندسة مونوريبوزيتوري","أنظمة البناء","إدارة التبعيات","تنمية مشاريع متعددة","Nx","Turborepo","Bazel","Lerna"]}},"owner":"KignLeon","repo":"joesmith-website","repoPath":"KignLeon/joesmith-website","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.648Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"monorepo-architect","description":"Expert in monorepo architecture, build systems, and dependency management at scale. Masters Nx, Turborepo, Bazel, and Lerna for efficient multi-project development. Use PROACTIVELY for monorepo setup,","bodyPreview":"# Monorepo Architect\n\nExpert in monorepo architecture, build systems, and dependency management at scale. Masters Nx, Turborepo, Bazel, and Lerna for efficient multi-project development. Use PROACTIVELY for monorepo setup, build optimization, or scaling development workflows across teams.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to monorepo architect\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Appl","body":"# Monorepo Architect\n\nExpert in monorepo architecture, build systems, and dependency management at scale. Masters Nx, Turborepo, Bazel, and Lerna for efficient multi-project development. Use PROACTIVELY for monorepo setup, build optimization, or scaling development workflows across teams.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to monorepo architect\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Monorepo tool selection (Nx, Turborepo, Bazel, Lerna)\n- Workspace configuration and project structure\n- Build caching (local and remote)\n- Dependency graph management\n- Affected/changed detection for CI optimization\n- Code sharing and library extraction\n- Task orchestration and parallelization\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Setting up a new monorepo from scratch\n- Migrating from polyrepo to monorepo\n- Optimizing slow CI/CD pipelines\n- Sharing code between multiple applications\n- Managing dependencies across projects\n- Implementing consistent tooling across teams\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Assess codebase size and team structure\n2. Select appropriate monorepo tooling\n3. Design workspace and project structure\n4. Configure build caching strategy\n5. Set up affected/changed detection\n6. Implement task pipelines\n7. Configure remote caching for CI\n8. Document conventions and workflows\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Start with clear project boundaries\n- Use consistent naming conventions\n- Implement remote caching early\n- Keep shared libraries focused\n- Use tags for dependency constraints\n- Automate dependency updates\n- Document the dependency graph\n- Set up code ownership rules\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:50.359Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing expertise in monorepo architecture and build system optimization.","zh":"非常适合需要在单体仓库架构和构建系统优化方面拥有专业知识的开发代理。","ja":"モノレポアーキテクチャとビルドシステムの最適化に関する専門知識が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"모노레포 아키텍처와 빌드 시스템 최적화에 대한 전문 지식이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan experiencia en arquitectura monorepo y optimización del sistema de compilación.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement ayant besoin d''expertise en architecture monorepo et d''optimisation du système de construction.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die Expertenwissen in Monorepo-Architektur und Build-System-Optimierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de especialização em arquitetura monorepo e otimização do sistema de compilação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы знания в области архитектуры monorepo и оптимизации системы сборки.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في هندسة مونوربو وتحسين نظام البناء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage multi-project development using tools like Nx, Turborepo, Bazel, and Lerna, streamlining build systems and dependency management at scale.","zh":"赋予代理高效管理多项目开发的能力，使用像Nx、Turborepo、Bazel和Lerna这样的工具，简化大规模的构建系统和依赖管理。","ja":"エージェントがNx、Turborepo、Bazel、Lernaなどのツールを使用して、マルチプロジェクト開発を効率的に管理し、大規模なビルドシステムと依存関係管理を簡素化する機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 Nx, Turborepo, Bazel 및 Lerna와 같은 도구를 사용하여 다중 프로젝트 개발을 효율적으로 관리하고 대규모 빌드 시스템 및 종속성 관리를 간소화하는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar de forma eficiente el desarrollo de múltiples proyectos utilizando herramientas como Nx, Turborepo, Bazel y Lerna, simplificando los sistemas de compilación y la administración de dependencias a gran escala.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer efficacement le développement de plusieurs projets en utilisant des outils tels que Nx, Turborepo, Bazel et Lerna, simplifiant ainsi les systèmes de construction et la gestion des dépendances à grande échelle.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mehrere Projekte mithilfe von Tools wie Nx, Turborepo, Bazel und Lerna effizient zu verwalten, wodurch Build-Systeme und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung im großen Maßstab gestreamt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar de forma eficiente o desenvolvimento de vários projetos usando ferramentas como Nx, Turborepo, Bazel e Lerna, simplificando os sistemas de compilação e gerenciamento de dependências em escala.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять разработкой нескольких проектов с помощью инструментов như Nx, Turborepo, Bazel и Lerna, оптимизируя системы сборки и управление зависимостями в масштабе.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة تطوير المشاريع المتعددة بفعالية باستخدام أدوات مثل Nx و Turborepo و Bazel و Lerna، وتبسيط أنظمة البناء وإدارة التبعيات على نطاق واسع."},"useCases":{"en":["Setting up monorepo architectures for large-scale projects","Optimizing build systems using Nx and Turborepo","Managing dependencies across multiple projects with Lerna and Bazel"],"zh":["为大规模项目设置单体仓库架构","使用Nx和Turborepo优化构建系统","使用Lerna和Bazel管理多个项目的依赖"],"ja":["大規模プロジェクトのモノレポアーキテクチャの設定","NxとTurborepoを使用したビルドシステムの最適化","LernaとBazelを使用した複数プロジェクトの依存関係管理"],"ko":["대규모 프로젝트를 위한 모노레포 아키텍처 설정","Nx 및 Turborepo를 사용한 빌드 시스템 최적화","Lerna 및 Bazel을 사용한 다중 프로젝트 의존성 관리"],"es":["Configuración de arquitecturas monorepo para proyectos a gran escala","Optimización de sistemas de compilación utilizando Nx y Turborepo","Administración de dependencias en varios proyectos con Lerna y Bazel"],"fr":["Configuration d''architectures monorepo pour des projets à grande échelle","Optimisation des systèmes de construction à l''aide de Nx et Turborepo","Gestion des dépendances sur plusieurs projets avec Lerna et Bazel"],"de":["Einrichtung von Monorepo-Architekturen für Großprojekte","Optimierung von Build-Systemen unter Verwendung von Nx und Turborepo","Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten in mehreren Projekten mit Lerna und Bazel"],"pt":["Configurando arquiteturas monorepo para projetos em larga escala","Otimizando sistemas de compilação usando Nx e Turborepo","Gerenciando dependências em vários projetos com Lerna e Bazel"],"ru":["Настройка архитектуры monorepo для крупномасштабных проектов","Оптимизация систем сборки с помощью Nx и Turborepo","Управление зависимостями в нескольких проектах с помощью Lerna и Bazel"],"ar":["تكوين هندسة مونوربو للمشاريع على نطاق واسع","تحسين أنظمة البناء باستخدام Nx و Turborepo","إدارة التبعيات عبر مشاريع متعددة باستخدام Lerna و Bazel"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of monorepo architecture and related tools","Limited to tasks related to monorepo setup, build optimization, and dependency management"],"zh":["需要单体仓库架构和相关工具的知识","仅限于与单体仓库设置、构建优化和依赖管理相关的任务"],"ja":["モノレポアーキテクチャと関連ツールの知識が必要","モノレポ設定、ビルド最適化、依存関係管理に関連するタスクに限定される"],"ko":["모노레포 아키텍처 및 관련 도구에 대한 지식이 필요","모노레포 설정, 빌드 최적화 및 종속성 관리와 관련된 태스크로 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de arquitectura monorepo y herramientas relacionadas","Limitado a tareas relacionadas con la configuración de monorepo, la optimización de la compilación y la administración de dependencias"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en architecture monorepo et en outils associés","Limité aux tâches liées à la configuration de monorepo, à l''optimisation de la construction et à la gestion des dépendances"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse in Monorepo-Architektur und verwandten Tools","Begrenzt auf Aufgaben im Zusammenhang mit Monorepo-Einrichtung, Build-Optimierung und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de arquitetura monorepo e ferramentas relacionadas","Limitado a tarefas relacionadas à configuração monorepo, otimização de compilação e gerenciamento de dependências"],"ru":["Требует знаний об архитектуре monorepo и связанных с ней инструментах","Ограничен задачами, связанными с настройкой monorepo, оптимизацией сборки и управлением зависимостями"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بهندسة مونوربو والأدوات المتصلة بها","محدود بالمهام المتعلقة بإعداد مونوربو وتحسين البناء وإدارة التبعيات"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"6512cb2fa6d981e8134e105c51606cadeb9b2c7237b00d0349b52fe55a0599a9","qualityScore":47}');
