de et de PR pour Go, qui facilite la séparation de la logique métier et de l''infrastructure","de":"Werkzeug für Code- und PR-Überprüfung für Go, das die Trennung von Geschäftslogik und Infrastruktur erleichtert","pt":"O review-code-and-pr é um modelo de repositório que separa a lógica de negócios da infraestrutura para melhorar a testabilidade e flexibilidade do código","ru":"ИИ Агент review-code-and-pr - это шаблон репозитория, который разделяет бизнес-логику и инфраструктуру для улучшения тестируемости и гибкости кода","ar":"وكيل المراجعة review-code-and-pr هو قالب لمستودع يفصل بين منطق العمل والبنية التحتية لتحسين إمكانية الاختبار ومرونة الكود"},"features":{"en":["Separates business logic code from infrastructure for easier testing and modification","Includes common boilerplate files for streamlined development","Outputs review verdicts in a structured format, including APPROVE or REQUEST_CHANGES","Provides a summary of changes and how they meet review criteria","Lists blockers that must be resolved before merging"],"zh":["代码组织和分离","基础设施代码与业务逻辑代码分离","常见的样板文件","输出审查结果，包括审查意见和建议","支持代码测试和修改"],"ja":["コードの整理と分離","インフラストラクチャコードとビジネスロジックコードの分離","一般的なボイラープレートファイル","レビューの結果を出力する，包括レビューの意見と提案","コードのテストと変更をサポートする"],"ko":["코드 정리와 분리","인프라스트럭처 코드와 비즈니스 로직 코드 분리","일반적인 보일러プレ이트 파일","리뷰 결과 출력，包括 리뷰 의견과 제안","코드 테스트와 수정을 지원하는"],"es":["Separación de lógica de negocio y infraestructura","Inclusión de archivos de plantilla comunes","Soporte para pruebas y cambios más fáciles","Compatibilidad con Go","Revisión de código y PR personalizable","Informes de revisión detallados"],"fr":["Séparation de la logique métier et de l''infrastructure","Inclusion de fichiers de modèle courants","Prise en charge de tests et de modifications plus faciles","Compatibilité avec Go","Examen de code et PR personnalisable","Rapports d''examen détaillés"],"de":["Trennung von Geschäftslogik und Infrastruktur","Einclusion von Vorlagen-Dateien","Unterstützung für einfache Tests und Änderungen","Kompatibilität mit Go","Anpassbare Code- und PR-Überprüfung","Detaillierte Überprüfungsberichte"],"pt":["Separação de lógica de negócios e infraestrutura","Inclusão de arquivos de modelo comuns","Melhoria da testabilidade e flexibilidade do código","Suporte a desenvolvimento de serviços Go","Integração com fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Разделение бизнес-логики и инфраструктуры","Включение общих шаблонов файлов","Улучшение тестируемости и гибкости кода","Поддержка разработки сервисов Go","Интеграция с рабочими процессами разработки"],"ar":["فصل منطق العمل والبنية التحتية","إدراج ملفات نموذجية شائعة","تحسين إمكانية الاختبار ومرونة الكود","دعم تطوير خدمات Go","التكامل مع سير عمل التطوير"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use review-code-and-pr","review-code-and-pr setup guide","review-code-and-pr alternative","review-code-and-pr vs git code review","review-code-and-pr install","what is review-code-and-pr","review-code-and-pr for Go developers","code review best practices with review-code-and-pr"],"zh":["代码审查","PR处理","AI工具","Go服务","代码组织","基础设施代码","业务逻辑代码","代码测试","代码修改"],"ja":["コードレビュー","PR処理","AIエージェント","Goサービス","コードの整理","インフラストラクチャコード","ビジネスロジックコード","コードのテスト","コードの変更"],"ko":["코드 리뷰","PR 처리","AI 도구","Go 서비스","코드 정리","인프라스트럭처 코드","비즈니스 로직 코드","코드 테스트","코드 수정"],"es":["revisión de código Go","PR Go","herramientas de desarrollo Go","mejores prácticas de código Go","plantillas de código Go","desarrollo de software Go","integración continua Go","pruebas de código Go","revisión de código automatizada"],"fr":["examen de code Go","PR Go","outils de développement Go","meilleures pratiques de code Go","modèles de code Go","développement de logiciels Go","intégration continue Go","tests de code Go","examen de code automatisé"],"de":["Code-Überprüfung Go","PR Go","Entwicklungstools Go","Best Practices für Go-Code","Code-Vorlagen Go","Software-Entwicklung Go","kontinuierliche Integration Go","Code-Tests Go","automatisierte Code-Überprüfung"],"pt":["review-code-and-pr","desenvolvimento de serviços Go","separação de lógica de negócios e infraestrutura","melhoria da testabilidade","flexibilidade do código","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","práticas de codificação"],"ru":["ИИ Агент review-code-and-pr","разработка сервисов Go","разделение бизнес-логики и инфраструктуры","улучшение тестируемости","гибкость кода","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","практики кодирования"],"ar":["وكيل المراجعة review-code-and-pr","تطوير خدمات Go","فصل منطق العمل والبنية التحتية","تحسين إمكانية الاختبار","مرونة الكود","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","ممارسات البرمجة"]}},"owner":"daominah","repo":"gostructure","repoPath":"daominah/gostructure","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T15:30:14Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"review-code-and-pr","description":"Review code changes and pull requests for business fit,","bodyPreview":"## Output Format\n\nOutput the review with these sections in order:\n\n- Verdict: APPROVE or REQUEST_CHANGES.\n- Summary: one paragraph describing what the change does\n  and how it meets the review criteria.\n- Blockers: issues that must be resolved before merging.\n  Only present when verdict is REQUEST_CHANGES.\n- Suggestions: improvements worth tracking as follow-ups.\n  Not blocking: the PR still solves the business need without them.\n- Nitpicks: minor observations that do not affect\n  correctness or","body":"## Output Format\n\nOutput the review with these sections in order:\n\n- Verdict: APPROVE or REQUEST_CHANGES.\n- Summary: one paragraph describing what the change does\n  and how it meets the review criteria.\n- Blockers: issues that must be resolved before merging.\n  Only present when verdict is REQUEST_CHANGES.\n- Suggestions: improvements worth tracking as follow-ups.\n  Not blocking: the PR still solves the business need without them.\n- Nitpicks: minor observations that do not affect\n  correctness or functionality.\n\nOmit Blockers, Suggestions, and Nitpicks if they have no items.\n\n## Review Criteria\n\n### Code Meets Business Need\n\n- The PR must link to its ticket (Linear/Jira), Slack thread, plan, etc.\n  if not linked: ask to link as a blocker.\n- Verify the PR describes the client pain point or use case being solved.\n- Verify the sources (ticket, report message, plan) are clear,\n  self-consistent, and consistent with each other.\n- For bugs: check whether we know how to reproduce it, How confirmed the root cause, is there a test that reproduces the bug. if not: blocker.\n  Optional: symptom of a deeper issue? Check similar past bugs.\n\n### Code Works as Intended\n\n- Every new, modified, or affected function must have a test proving it works.\n- For bug fixes: a test that reproduces the bug and passes after the fix.\n- For new features: tests must cover the main use case.\n  Edge cases are optional but encouraged.\n- Test comments use GIVEN (precondition) / WHEN (action) / THEN (result)\n  to describe business behavior, readable by non-technical stakeholders.\n\n### Do Not Break Existing Behavior\n\n- Existing tests may not cover all behaviors.\n  Check for changes that could break untested code paths.\n- Purely additive changes can still degrade performance.\n  Check for slow queries, missing indexes, or unnecessary load on shared resources.\n- If the PR is too large to review confidently,\n  note it as process feedback to prefer smaller PRs in future work.\n\n### Observable Output\n\n- Check that the change has observable output the user can verify,\n  for example through the UI or a public API response.\n- Long-running functions or background jobs provide a way to inspect\n  progress through metrics, a dashboard, a status endpoint, logs, or database records.\n- Support for cancellation is a nice to have.\n\n### Security Considerations\n\n- Check for hardcoded secrets, credentials, or real customer data in the code.\n- Review risks from user inputs: is validation sufficient?\n- Check if the change exposes sensitive data in API responses or error messages.\n\n### Code Quality\n\n- Code should be easy to read, change, and debug by someone who didn''t write it.\n- Improve the codebase where you touch it.\n  Keep cleanup in separate commits from feature work for easier review and revert.\n- Label nitpicks clearly so the author knows what is blocking vs optional.\n\n### Process Feedback\n\nIf the review finds serious problems,\nsuch as vague requirements that led to solving the wrong need,\ncontradictory source materials, or the wrong approach,\nadd recommendations to prevent similar issues in future work:\n\n- Requirements should be clear and agreed on before coding starts.\n- The solution approach should be confirmed before implementation.\n- This prevents misalignment earlier in future work.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:17:31.822Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing structured analysis and feedback generation for pull requests.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化分析和反馈生成的代码审查代理，特别是针对Pull Request的审查。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが構造化された分析とフィードバックの生成を必要とするPull Requestに最適です。","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 구조화된 분석 및 피드백 생성을 필요로 하는 풀 리퀘스트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Revisión de Código que necesitan análisis estructurado y generación de retroalimentación para solicitudes de incorporación.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une analyse structurée et une génération de rétroaction pour les demandes d''intégration.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die eine strukturierte Analyse und Feedbackgenerierung für Pull-Requests benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agents de Revisão de Código que necessitam de análise estruturada e geração de feedback para pull requests.","ru":"Идеально для агентов код-ревью, требующих структурированного анализа и генерации отзывов для запросов на включение.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء مراجعة الكود الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل منظم وتوليد ملاحظات للطلبات السحابية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to provide detailed code reviews using standardized templates, including verdicts, summaries, blockers, suggestions, and nitpicks, all while leveraging output formats like JSON for seamless integration with development workflows.","zh":"赋予代理提供详细的代码审查功能，使用标准化模板，包括裁定、摘要、阻塞器、建议和微小的建议，所有这些都利用像JSON这样的输出格式，以便与开发工作流无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントが標準化されたテンプレートを使用して詳細なコードレビューを提供できるようにし、JSONなどの出力形式を活用して開発ワークフローと無縫に統合します。","ko":"에이전트가 표준화된 템플릿을 사용하여详细한 코드 리뷰를 제공할 수 있도록 하며, JSON과 같은 출력 형식을 활용하여 개발 워크플ロー와無縫に統合합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para proporcionar revisiones de código detalladas utilizando plantillas estandarizadas, incluyendo veredictos, resúmenes, bloqueadores, sugerencias y detalles, todo mientras aprovecha formatos de salida como JSON para una integración sin problemas con flujos de trabajo de desarrollo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de fournir des révisions de code détaillées en utilisant des modèles standardisés, incluant des verdicts, des résumés, des bloqueurs, des suggestions et des détails, le tout en exploitant des formats de sortie tels que JSON pour une intégration transparente avec les flux de travail de développement.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, detaillierte Code-Reviews unter Verwendung standardisierter Vorlagen bereitzustellen, einschließlich Urteilen, Zusammenfassungen, Blockierern, Vorschlägen und Details, all dies unter Ausnutzung von Ausgabeformaten wie JSON für eine nahtlose Integration in Entwicklungswerkflüsse.","pt":"Habilita agentes a fornecer revisões de código detalhadas usando modelos padronizados, incluindo vereditos, resumos, bloqueadores, sugestões e observações, tudo isso aproveitando formatos de saída como JSON para integração perfeita com fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью предоставлять подробные код-ревью, используя стандартизированные шаблоны, включая вердикты, сводки, блокировщики, предложения и придирки, все это при использовании форматов вывода, таких как JSON, для бесшовной интеграции с рабочими процессами разработки.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تقديم مراجعات شاملة للكود باستخدام قوالب موحدة، بما في ذلك الأحكام والملخصات والحواجز والاقتراحات والملاحظات، كل ذلك بالاستفادة من تنسيقات الإخراج مثل JSON من أجل التكامل السلس مع سير عمل التطوير."},"useCases":{"en":["Standardizing code review processes","Automating pull request feedback generation","Improving code quality through structured analysis"],"zh":["标准化代码审查流程","自动化Pull Request反馈生成","通过结构化分析提高代码质量"],"ja":["コードレビューのプロセスを標準化する","プルリクエストのフィードバックを自動生成する","構造化された分析によってコードの品質を向上させる"],"ko":["코드 리뷰 프로세스를 표준화하는","풀 리퀘스트의 피드백을 자동 생성하는","구조화된 분석에 의한 코드 품질 향상"],"es":["Estandarizar procesos de revisión de código","Automatizar la generación de retroalimentación de solicitudes de incorporación","Mejorar la calidad del código a través de un análisis estructurado"],"fr":["Standardiser les processus de révision de code","Automatiser la génération de rétroaction pour les demandes d''intégration","Améliorer la qualité du code grâce à une analyse structurée"],"de":["Standardisieren von Code-Review-Prozessen","Automatisieren der Feedbackgenerierung für Pull-Requests","Verbesserung der Codequalität durch strukturierte Analyse"],"pt":["Padronizar processos de revisão de código","Automatizar geração de feedback para pull requests","Melhorar a qualidade do código por meio de análise estruturada"],"ru":["Стандартизировать процессы код-ревью","Автоматизировать генерацию отзывов для запросов на включение","Улучшать качество кода посредством структурированного анализа"],"ar":["تدوين عمليات مراجعة الكود","تأتمتية توليد ملاحظات للطلبات السحابية","تحسين جودة الكود من خلال التحليل المنظم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to code repositories","Limited to Go services and infrastructure"],"zh":["需要访问代码仓库","仅限于Go服务和基础设施"],"ja":["コードリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","Goサービスとインフラストラクチャのみに限定される"],"ko":["코드 저장소에 대한 액세스가 필요","Go 서비스 및 인프라에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a repositorios de código","Limitado a servicios y infraestructura Go"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux référentiels de code","Limité aux services et infrastructures Go"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Code-Repositorys","Begrenzt auf Go-Dienste und -Infrastruktur"],"pt":["Requer acesso a repositórios de código","Limitado a serviços e infraestrutura Go"],"ru":["Требует доступа к кодовым репозиториям","Ограничен службами и инфраструктурой Go"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودعات الكود","محدود بخدمات وبنية Go"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"b57fbb6c7b01216500544f71734f8462cd67acc924c8916027bc027037be10d4","qualityScore":47}');
