INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('marketcalls/vectorbt-backtesting-skills/strategy-compare', 'strategy-compare', 'marketcalls', 'vectorbt-backtesting-skills', 'community', 'strategy-compare marketcalls vectorbt-backtesting-skills community agent-skills backtesting monte-carlo optimization python quantstats robustness tearsheets vectorbt walk-forward The strategy-compare skill allows developers to backtest trading strategies using VectorBT, supporting Indian, US, and Crypto markets. It benefits developers and traders who need to compare and optimize their strategies. 使用策略比较工具，比较不同的交易策略，支持VectorBT，包括现实的交易成本建模和12个预制的策略模板 戦略比較ツールを使用して、異なる取引戦略を比較します。VectorBTをサポートし、現実的な取引コストモデリングと12の戦略テンプレートを備えています 전략 비교 도구를 사용하여 다른 거래 전략을 비교합니다. VectorBT를 지원하며 실제 거래 비용 모델링 및 12개의 전략 템플릿을 제공합니다 La habilidad strategy-compare permite a los desarrolladores comparar estrategias de trading utilizando VectorBT y QuantStats en diferentes mercados La compétence strategy-compare permet aux développeurs de comparer des stratégies de trading à l''aide de VectorBT et QuantStats sur différents marchés Die Fähigkeit strategy-compare ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Handelsstrategien mit VectorBT und QuantStats in verschiedenen Märkten zu vergleichen O strategy-compare é uma habilidade de codificação agente para testar estratégias de negociação usando VectorBT Strategy-compare - это навык агентского кодирования для тестирования торговых стратегий с помощью VectorBT strategy-compare هو مهارة ترميز وكلية لاختبار استراتيجيات التداول باستخدام VectorBT how to use strategy-compare strategy-compare alternative strategy-compare setup guide what is strategy-compare strategy-compare vs backtrader vectorbt backtesting quantstats tearsheets trading strategy optimization monte-carlo simulation in trading walk-forward optimization 策略比较工具 VectorBT 交易策略优化 AI工具 量化交易 Python编程 TA-Lib指标 QuantStats tearsheets Supports backtesting of trading strategies using VectorBT Features realistic transaction cost modeling for accurate results Includes 12 ready-made strategy templates for easy comparison Utilizes QuantStats tearsheets for in-depth strategy analysis Allows for Monte-Carlo simulations and walk-forward optimization Supports TA-Lib indicators for technical analysis strategy-compare is a coding skill for backtesting trading strategies using VectorBT, supporting multiple markets and featuring realistic transaction cost modeling.');
