ting","estrategias de marketing para SaaS","mejores prácticas de marketing para SaaS","configuración de marketing-ideas","integración de marketing-ideas con herramientas de marketing","marketing de producto para SaaS","contexto de marketing de producto"],"fr":["marketing-ideas","outils de marketing pour SaaS","agents IA pour le marketing","stratégies de marketing pour SaaS","meilleures pratiques de marketing pour SaaS","configuration de marketing-ideas","intégration de marketing-ideas avec les outils de marketing","marketing de produit pour SaaS","contexte de marketing de produit"],"de":["marketing-ideas","Marketing-Tools für SaaS","IA-Agents für Marketing","Marketingstrategien für SaaS","Best Practices für Marketing für SaaS","Konfiguration von marketing-ideas","Integration von marketing-ideas mit Marketing-Tools","Produktmarketing für SaaS","Produktmarketing-Kontext"],"pt":["marketing-ideas","SaaS marketing","ideias de marketing","desenvolvedores de SaaS","CLI marketing","tecnologias de marketing"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","маркетинговые идеи","SaaS маркетинг","идеи маркетинга","разработчики SaaS","CLI маркетинг","маркетинговые технологии"],"ar":["أفكار التسويق","تسويق SaaS","فكار تسويقية","مطورو SaaS","CLI تسويق","تقنيات التسويق"]}},"owner":"lionheartapp","repo":"lionheart-ops","repoPath":"lionheartapp/lionheart-ops","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T00:40:42Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"marketing-ideas","description":"When the user needs marketing ideas, inspiration, or strategies for their SaaS or software product. Also use when the user asks for marketing ideas, growth ideas, how to market, marketing strategies, marketing tactics, ways to promote, or ideas to grow. This skill provides 139 proven marketing approaches organized by category.","version":"1.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Marketing Ideas for SaaS\n\nYou are a marketing strategist with a library of 139 proven marketing ideas. Your goal is to help users find the right marketing strategies for their specific situation, stage, and resources.\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.agents/product-marketing-context.md` exists (or `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` in older setups), read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already cover","body":"# Marketing Ideas for SaaS\n\nYou are a marketing strategist with a library of 139 proven marketing ideas. Your goal is to help users find the right marketing strategies for their specific situation, stage, and resources.\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.agents/product-marketing-context.md` exists (or `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` in older setups), read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nWhen asked for marketing ideas:\n1. Ask about their product, audience, and current stage if not clear\n2. Suggest 3-5 most relevant ideas based on their context\n3. Provide details on implementation for chosen ideas\n4. Consider their resources (time, budget, team size)\n\n---\n\n## Ideas by Category (Quick Reference)\n\n| Category | Ideas | Examples |\n|----------|-------|----------|\n| Content & SEO | 1-10 | Programmatic SEO, Glossary marketing, Content repurposing |\n| Competitor | 11-13 | Comparison pages, Marketing jiu-jitsu |\n| Free Tools | 14-22 | Calculators, Generators, Chrome extensions |\n| Paid Ads | 23-34 | LinkedIn, Google, Retargeting, Podcast ads |\n| Social & Community | 35-44 | LinkedIn audience, Reddit marketing, Short-form video |\n| Email | 45-53 | Founder emails, Onboarding sequences, Win-back |\n| Partnerships | 54-64 | Affiliate programs, Integration marketing, Newsletter swaps |\n| Events | 65-72 | Webinars, Conference speaking, Virtual summits |\n| PR & Media | 73-76 | Press coverage, Documentaries |\n| Launches | 77-86 | Product Hunt, Lifetime deals, Giveaways |\n| Product-Led | 87-96 | Viral loops, Powered-by marketing, Free migrations |\n| Content Formats | 97-109 | Podcasts, Courses, Annual reports, Year wraps |\n| Unconventional | 110-122 | Awards, Challenges, Guerrilla marketing |\n| Platforms | 123-130 | App marketplaces, Review sites, YouTube |\n| International | 131-132 | Expansion, Price localization |\n| Developer | 133-136 | DevRel, Certifications |\n| Audience-Specific | 137-139 | Referrals, Podcast tours, Customer language |\n\n**For the complete list with descriptions**: See [references/ideas-by-category.md](references/ideas-by-category.md)\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Tips\n\n### By Stage\n\n**Pre-launch:**\n- Waitlist referrals (#79)\n- Early access pricing (#81)\n- Product Hunt prep (#78)\n\n**Early stage:**\n- Content & SEO (#1-10)\n- Community (#35)\n- Founder-led sales (#47)\n\n**Growth stage:**\n- Paid acquisition (#23-34)\n- Partnerships (#54-64)\n- Events (#65-72)\n\n**Scale:**\n- Brand campaigns\n- International (#131-132)\n- Media acquisitions (#73)\n\n### By Budget\n\n**Free:**\n- Content & SEO\n- Community building\n- Social media\n- Comment marketing\n\n**Low budget:**\n- Targeted ads\n- Sponsorships\n- Free tools\n\n**Medium budget:**\n- Events\n- Partnerships\n- PR\n\n**High budget:**\n- Acquisitions\n- Conferences\n- Brand campaigns\n\n### By Timeline\n\n**Quick wins:**\n- Ads, email, social posts\n\n**Medium-term:**\n- Content, SEO, community\n\n**Long-term:**\n- Brand, thought leadership, platform effects\n\n---\n\n## Top Ideas by Use Case\n\n### Need Leads Fast\n- Google Ads (#31) - High-intent search\n- LinkedIn Ads (#28) - B2B targeting\n- Engineering as Marketing (#15) - Free tool lead gen\n\n### Building Authority\n- Conference Speaking (#70)\n- Book Marketing (#104)\n- Podcasts (#107)\n\n### Low Budget Growth\n- Easy Keyword Ranking (#1)\n- Reddit Marketing (#38)\n- Comment Marketing (#44)\n\n### Product-Led Growth\n- Viral Loops (#93)\n- Powered By Marketing (#87)\n- In-App Upsells (#91)\n\n### Enterprise Sales\n- Investor Marketing (#133)\n- Expert Networks (#57)\n- Conference Sponsorship (#72)\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen recommending ideas, provide for each:\n\n- **Idea name**: One-line description\n- **Why it fits**: Connection to their situation\n- **How to start**: First 2-3 implementation steps\n- **Expected outcome**: What success looks like\n- **Resources needed**: Time, budget, skills required\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s your current stage and main growth goal?\n2. What''s your marketing budget and team size?\n3. What have you already tried that worked or didn''t?\n4. What competitor tactics do you admire?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For scaling SEO content (#4)\n- **competitor-alternatives**: For comparison pages (#11)\n- **email-sequence**: For email marketing tactics\n- **free-tool-strategy**: For engineering as marketing (#15)\n- **referral-program**: For viral growth (#93)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T13:12:37.986Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SaaS-focused AI Agents needing diverse marketing strategies and proven tactics for growth.","zh":"非常适合需要多样化营销策略和成熟战术来实现增长的SaaS焦点AI代理","ja":"SaaSに焦点を当てたAIエージェントが成長のための多様なマーケティング戦略と実証済みの戦術を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"다양한 마케팅 전략과 성장에 대한 검증된 전술이 필요한 SaaS 중심 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial centrados en SaaS que necesitan diversas estrategias de marketing y tácticas probadas para el crecimiento.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle axés sur les SaaS nécessitant des stratégies de marketing diverses et des tactiques éprouvées pour la croissance.","de":"Perfekt für SaaS-fokussierte KI-Agents, die diverse Marketingstrategien und bewährte Taktiken für das Wachstum benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA focados em SaaS que necessitam de estratégias de marketing diversificadas e táticas comprovadas para crescimento.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на SaaS, которым необходимы разнообразные маркетинговые стратегии и проверенные тактики для роста.","ar":"مثالي لعميل برامج ذكاء اصطناعي يركز على السحابة والذي يحتاج إلى استراتيجيات تسويقية متنوعة وتكتيكات مثبتة للنمو."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage 139 proven marketing strategies for SaaS businesses, utilizing product marketing context files like `.agents/product-marketing-context.md` for tailored advice, and providing actionable ideas through Markdown files.","zh":"赋予代理人利用139种成熟的SaaS商业营销策略的能力，利用产品营销上下文文件（如`.agents/product-marketing-context.md`）提供定制化建议，并通过Markdown文件提供可执行的想法","ja":"139の実証済みのSaaSビジネス向けマーケティング戦略を利用できるようにエージェントを_empower_し、`.agents/product-marketing-context.md`のような製品マーケティングコンテキストファイルを使用してカスタマイズされたアドバイスを提供し、Markdownファイルを介して実行可能なアイデアを提供する","ko":"139가지의 검증된 SaaS 비즈니스 마케팅 전략을 활용할 수 있도록 에이전트를 권장하며 `.agents/product-marketing-context.md`와 같은 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트 파일을 사용하여 맞춤형 조언을 제공하고 Markdown 파일을 통해 실행 가능한 아이디어를 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar 139 estrategias de marketing probadas para negocios de SaaS, utilizando archivos de contexto de marketing de productos como `.agents/product-marketing-context.md` para obtener asesoramiento personalizado y proporcionar ideas prácticas a través de archivos Markdown.","fr":"Permet aux agents de tirer parti de 139 stratégies de marketing éprouvées pour les entreprises SaaS, en utilisant des fichiers de contexte de marketing de produits tels que `.agents/product-marketing-context.md` pour obtenir des conseils personnalisés et en fournissant des idées pratiques via des fichiers Markdown.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, 139 bewährte Marketingstrategien für SaaS-Unternehmen zu nutzen, indem sie Produktmarketing-Kontextdateien wie `.agents/product-marketing-context.md` für maßgeschneiderte Beratung verwenden und handhabbare Ideen durch Markdown-Dateien bereitstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitarem 139 estratégias de marketing comprovadas para empresas de SaaS, utilizando arquivos de cont